# Normalise line endings in the repository, not in the working tree.
#
# This is a Node package that may be checked out on any platform, and the Windows
# default here is `core.autocrlf=true`: without this file the committed blobs
# would carry CRLF, and a checkout on Linux would then see CRLF in a JS source
# file and a lockfile it has to rewrite. `text=auto` keeps LF in the repository
# and still lets a Windows working tree hold CRLF if it wants to.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything whose bytes matter must never be line-ending-converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
